t-order extension"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source statement and standard first-order extension checked; full proof not independently reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf T_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_T\">\\(\\mathcal Q_T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d48429d76b7862cc\" href=\"?note=d48429d76b7862cc\" title=\"72-df-tait-calculus\">72-df-tait-calculus</a> 的独立一侧有限集合演算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal Q_T\\)</span>。证明与推导使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的通用接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf T_\\Sigma+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T)\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf T_\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathsf T_\\Sigma+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_T)\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\to\\ \\mathsf T_\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由经典有限相继式切消及NNF桥得到，不能把Tait的一侧集合直接输入SeqΣ。源书的命题部分明确陈述normalization；一阶有限量词扩展使用相应量词归约。此处核对陈述与条件，未复写全部翻译和归约证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tait-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"d48429d76b7862cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tait-calculus]]","embed":fa